id: temporal/grammar/0672
area: temporal
op: Temporal.PlainDate.from (string), toString
in: str:"2020-01-01T12:00+24:00"
out: error: RangeError
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row G8: PlainDate, PlainDateTime, PlainYearMonth and PlainMonthDay match an offset after a time without its range, so +24:00, +23:60 and +23:59:60 are accepted, where UTCOffset's hour is 00 to 23 and its minute and second 00 to 59; correction (a lenient grammar acceptance), answered by SJL-10.5
