divergence.broiler-js: row G3: a year-month string's day is captured and validated only outside ISO 8601 and the Gregorian family, so a year-month whose day is not a date (2020-02-30, 2020-01-00, 2021-02-29) is read as its year-month, where DateSpec's early error makes it a RangeError; correction (a lenient grammar acceptance), answered by SJL-10.5
