class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row G4: PlainTime's parser matches a date-time's date as any two digits and never validates it, so the time of 2021-13-45T12:00 or 2020-02-30T12:00 is 12:00:00, where the date must be a date; correction (a lenient grammar acceptance), answered by SJL-10.5
prov: proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal-iso8601grammar proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal-parseisodatetime proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal.plaintime.from ref:temporalref@1
