id: temporal/grammar/1871
area: temporal
op: GetTemporalRelativeToOption (string), Duration.prototype.round
in: str:"P1M" str:"day" str:"2020-01-01[u-ca=hebrew]"
out: value: str:"P1M"
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row D11: relativeTo in another calendar: round, total and compare throw a plain Error, "a relativeTo with the ... calendar is not yet implemented", where GetTemporalRelativeToOption takes any calendar; and a ZonedDateTime relativeTo in coptic rounds with ISO months (P1M14D for P1M15D), which the row does not record; correction, answered by SJL-10.5
prov: proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal-gettemporalrelativetooption proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal-parseisodatetime ref:temporalref@1
